{"id": "official:sentence:870d19ac-3841-4e0c-9dd3-9e63124e2abb", "text": "我一向都早睡早起。", "shortMeaning": "我向来睡得早、起得早。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7261d2dc-ce02-48b5-a1ce-6f2d0704bee9", "text": "我一喝了酒就立刻变得通红。", "shortMeaning": "我一沾酒，脸马上红透。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3ec9cefa-7f87-4e83-8361-a430d8963419", "text": "我一回到家就打电话给你。", "shortMeaning": "我一到家就给你打电话。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:20c1503e-6590-488c-8d83-94e715207189", "text": "我一坐下就睡著了。", "shortMeaning": "我屁股一落座就睡着了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2ab10ed3-be46-48ba-8229-8a282e9eae6d", "text": "我一天也离不开这本字典。", "shortMeaning": "这本词典我一天都离不开。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9d042da2-0897-4aee-b8b3-7c2dea8a9c35", "text": "我一天到晚看电视。", "shortMeaning": "我从早到晚地看电视。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0a0c4f42-0235-4781-a36a-d6bcf53e1f56", "text": "我一天又一天地给她写信。", "shortMeaning": "我一天一天地给她写信。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7eac25cc-1fc7-4b69-99c0-f4e2e1a8dd7f", "text": "我一天吃了三次黑米粥！", "shortMeaning": "我一天里吃了三顿黑米粥！", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:efe08667-99c3-419f-a643-797dcd4f3b0f", "text": "我一定是把它遗留在巴士上了。", "shortMeaning": "我准是把它落在公交车上了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:40ba1b0a-a0e0-4ce5-8ca8-7cfee3b3a18b", "text": "我一定要努力学习，决不辜负父母的期望。", "shortMeaning": "我一定好好念书，不叫爹妈失望。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:36cd6435-d6df-4f7b-b165-cbda9146ec7c", "text": "我一定要把香烟戒了！", "shortMeaning": "我非把烟戒掉不可！", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d830d10c-baf8-4886-84aa-560bef3ca164", "text": "我一得到一大笔钱就捐一部分给慈善机构。", "shortMeaning": "我一拿到大钱，就捐一份给慈善机构。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f5f10427-1284-4c84-b34b-4fd853ff391e", "text": "我一想起他就会感到很愉快。", "shortMeaning": "一想到他，我心里就舒坦。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2c0631e3-70b8-44dc-a6af-301069df1c9f", "text": "我一把这本书读完了就借给你。", "shortMeaning": "这本书我看完就借你。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:538c4aa5-4ee7-4718-95ce-14c4a1f1fe81", "text": "我一整天都在看这本小说。", "shortMeaning": "这本小说我看了一整天。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b8250631-952f-46bf-a5fb-cb213f0b5115", "text": "我一整天都没见到你。", "shortMeaning": "我一整天没见着你。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:91408ea5-4e3d-485b-a87f-14a3bb3a0e41", "text": "我一整天都觉得很消沉。", "shortMeaning": "我一整天都提不起劲。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:87511b42-d11c-42f2-8425-b504d109cea4", "text": "我一有钱马上就还你。", "shortMeaning": "我手头一有钱就还你。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6e13bc69-b7dc-4427-b199-b25bac61565f", "text": "我一有问题就用谷歌查一下。", "shortMeaning": "我遇上问题就用搜索引擎查。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:608cd0a5-20c9-494a-b7c2-bf7409bb5de1", "text": "我一来就在洗碗，你凭什么叫我走！", "shortMeaning": "我一来就洗碗，你凭什么赶我走！", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9f63b827-205b-4df5-9c18-ce0f2423109b", "text": "我一次也没见过他。", "shortMeaning": "我跟他一回都没见过。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:723e4cff-1fec-4562-a9ee-80cf6920dedc", "text": "我一步萨尔萨都不会跳。", "shortMeaning": "萨尔萨舞我一步都不会。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:449b721a-10ff-4960-9be7-2403b4131e7c", "text": "我一点也不会游泳。", "shortMeaning": "我一点儿也不会游水。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a51e964e-6ff0-4212-b570-61d24488da88", "text": "我一点也不怕他威胁。", "shortMeaning": "他吓唬我，我一点也不怕。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e5fc50e4-0a8b-4cf2-9be8-5cbd0ea85f29", "text": "我一点也不羡慕你的生活。", "shortMeaning": "你的日子我一点也不眼红。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c7e41cc9-338a-4fcf-9294-764e8247dda6", "text": "我一点也没有要辞职的意思。", "shortMeaning": "我压根没想辞职。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6a7a6432-b50f-4f15-b184-ba6f84216a9b", "text": "我一点儿也不怕狗。", "shortMeaning": "我一点都不怕狗。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f19a9226-182d-44cc-8bb7-126a9c4a290c", "text": "我一点儿小病，你用不着来看我的！", "shortMeaning": "我不过小毛病，你不用来看我！", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c37d2445-e291-47c1-a887-a784b3a5c0ad", "text": "我一点儿钱也没有。", "shortMeaning": "我手头一分钱也没有。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3b31d8f8-ac17-4a66-816d-92df2a8405b1", "text": "我一点法语都不懂。", "shortMeaning": "法语我一点也不懂。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0d90e049-c524-47de-9f19-08104b50b8f6", "text": "我一点英文都不会说。", "shortMeaning": "英文我一句也说不上来。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6cff9dcd-810b-4a3e-a45d-8f4cb7dcff7d", "text": "我一点英语也不懂。", "shortMeaning": "英语我完全不懂。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:69a69690-eb22-4eb9-be78-c32031bd390b", "text": "我一点都不知道她是谁。", "shortMeaning": "我压根不知道她是什么人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:297bbf64-416f-4215-a432-6674c359e018", "text": "我一点都不知道这会给你带来那么多问题。", "shortMeaning": "我一点没想到这会给你惹出那么多麻烦。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4f83153e-67b2-49d5-acef-5d98a3ec5806", "text": "我一生中从没见过那么多血。", "shortMeaning": "我这辈子没见过那么多血。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:844da0b4-d39e-4330-a35f-923ca4ac6060", "text": "我一生中从没那么糗过。", "shortMeaning": "我一辈子没那么丢脸过。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:bc041604-dc9c-4941-b46c-a705b058986d", "text": "我一生都谨慎行事。", "shortMeaning": "我一辈子做事都小心。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:321abdc4-2c91-41ce-a08a-89c9a7196000", "text": "我一百八十二厘米身高。", "shortMeaning": "我身高一米八二。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9bce00fa-18ac-491e-b5b9-fbc3ea1c0c33", "text": "我一直在忙着修东西。", "shortMeaning": "我一直在忙着修这修那。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:069ecb1b-dd0e-40e5-849b-918ee4c7d65e", "text": "我一直忙于写一部短篇小说。", "shortMeaning": "我一直忙着写一篇短篇小说。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:dc77b567-4a5e-44b3-beb2-dbfd608abf39", "text": "我一直想成为一名职业篮球运动员。", "shortMeaning": "我一直想当职业篮球手。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ab543557-97aa-4ff6-a0ee-5c0969dc270f", "text": "我一直想登富士山。", "shortMeaning": "我一直想爬富士山。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7387ce1f-270d-4094-8940-1e10b88475e4", "text": "我一直相信这会发生。", "shortMeaning": "我始终相信这事会来。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d8b7521a-5006-4991-8302-c82284772293", "text": "我一直试着去遵守我的承诺。", "shortMeaning": "我一直试着守自己许下的话。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b8fb9653-4492-4c02-863b-c29b1bb98885", "text": "我一直这么认为并且坚持。", "shortMeaning": "我一直这么想，也一直这么坚持。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:11ba6515-70ae-41d8-856a-9cdbadc0f265", "text": "我一直都想去土耳其。", "shortMeaning": "我一直都想到土耳其去。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5fcb40a1-aef2-498b-9736-060d6140d13f", "text": "我一直都相信你的判断。", "shortMeaning": "你的判断我一直信。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5709787f-63f3-438a-990d-045011ac78c0", "text": "我一直都真心实意地对你，你为什么要骗我？", "shortMeaning": "我一向真心待你，你干吗骗我？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a7e017c9-8c71-4c70-a912-58c79c92eff7", "text": "我一看到你就想到你母亲。", "shortMeaning": "我一见你就想起你妈。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3bc3efce-c12c-43b0-bef7-920e859b9fb2", "text": "我一站起来就觉得头晕。", "shortMeaning": "我一站起来就发晕。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e170f5bf-de58-4a00-a224-c30231b2a9bf", "text": "我一辈子都是个流浪者。", "shortMeaning": "我一辈子都在四处漂泊。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:436334f7-3ef8-4f44-8fe2-77300f516157", "text": "我一面系鞋带，一面叫他把我的包拿过来。", "shortMeaning": "我边系鞋带边叫他递我的包。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:70a20b30-4925-4625-a34b-7a0634c65ad7", "text": "我七岁时，我父亲去世了。", "shortMeaning": "我七岁那年父亲过世了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:87a4b20a-cf89-4483-9f98-58b653110ffa", "text": "我七点左右来就可以了吧？", "shortMeaning": "我七点上下过来，行吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7dfa781b-94f8-482f-8929-33f3e813406a", "text": "我丈夫一边吃早餐一边读报纸。", "shortMeaning": "我丈夫边吃早饭边看报。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e859a991-0055-4ad3-837d-a3b4fcf2a756", "text": "我三周前买了辆摩托车。", "shortMeaning": "三周前我买了辆摩托。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2642b044-eba5-418b-b71d-88c870bef406", "text": "我三天以来没吃一点东西。", "shortMeaning": "我这三天什么都没吃。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b24888ba-e035-44a6-b96c-26bb8ce9ce89", "text": "我三年前住在日本。", "shortMeaning": "三年前我住在日本。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:903e13ce-4b8a-4822-aeea-a6b10f24b2a4", "text": "我三月二十二号生日。", "shortMeaning": "我生日是三月二十二。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a6965f2b-f590-441c-8543-a3493104e3ec", "text": "我上个月组织了一个结婚仪式。", "shortMeaning": "上个月我操办了一场婚礼。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:108aed53-50d4-4069-bdc8-2876ea82a8c6", "text": "我上个礼拜把她介绍给你了。", "shortMeaning": "上礼拜我就把她介绍你了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2708255e-842a-429a-9798-64cbe214e4d1", "text": "我上了当，还以为他们的玩笑是真的呢。", "shortMeaning": "我上了当，竟把他们的玩笑信以为真。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7917189c-e561-465f-a04e-8f590f03a97f", "text": "我上周开始学中文了。", "shortMeaning": "上礼拜我开始学中文。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9383a701-da2e-4f2e-a23e-fce5de485592", "text": "我上周把她介绍给你了。", "shortMeaning": "上周我已把她介绍给你。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e8ec1132-34a8-4d40-b336-47ce14b72e78", "text": "我上床之前忘记关电视机了。", "shortMeaning": "我睡前忘了关电视。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:52bfc455-5759-4d0a-9198-89beddd9b420", "text": "我上次去过了中国，我访问了上海。", "shortMeaning": "上回我去了中国，到了上海。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f52e415e-d3c5-4809-a305-4b7341909c43", "text": "我上次计算，估计我已经学会了两千五百个汉字左右。", "shortMeaning": "我上回算了算，估摸着学会了约两千五百个汉字。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:320fc18d-7790-4966-95e3-f71dffe241f7", "text": "我上高中的时候学过法语。", "shortMeaning": "我念高中时学过法语。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4be2e78a-5465-463d-85b6-924b5b84cccf", "text": "我下一部作品名字叫 「血肠历险记」 。", "shortMeaning": "我下一部作品叫《血肠历险记》。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:53d25d79-a444-48ce-bae7-0a2186a94a70", "text": "我下个月要搬家了。", "shortMeaning": "下个月我要搬住处了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:bac597b8-f67e-40d1-b1d8-9bb96150c2a1", "text": "我下定决心要在三年之内达成目标。", "shortMeaning": "我拿定主意，三年内把目标做成。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:bae11c45-33e2-4629-8b65-62adf84c3929", "text": "我下月可能去澳洲。", "shortMeaning": "下个月我可能去澳洲。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:96864f04-9cab-48bc-8c98-542a5bbabb76", "text": "我不一定相信翻译。", "shortMeaning": "译文我不见得都信。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8d00d047-b200-4b5a-b614-6aeba0c1e210", "text": "我不久前出了车祸。", "shortMeaning": "前些日子我出了车祸。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:93bdc198-d0b0-4037-b05f-f3a4bdb981ea", "text": "我不乘公交去学校。", "shortMeaning": "我不坐公交车上学。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:dbe88a9f-87d0-47d6-8db0-ef55d023b66c", "text": "我不介意你留在这里。", "shortMeaning": "你留在这儿我不介意。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1c06e694-e6d0-4de9-aa96-7d19ea6c6780", "text": "我不介意在雨中漫步。", "shortMeaning": "在雨里走走我不介意。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c70c4e87-8077-458b-aaed-2f928c3c8b1c", "text": "我不会再说这句话了。", "shortMeaning": "这话我不会再说了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9f02fa83-89ad-418d-81fa-2b6073e06048", "text": "我不会再跟你说法文了。", "shortMeaning": "我不再跟你讲法语了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:efb338a6-adac-4409-a30f-30f83fee8872", "text": "我不会写繁体字，但我可以读。", "shortMeaning": "繁体字我不会写，却能认。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:050a9f88-d99b-47b3-a061-6af13676df3d", "text": "我不会卖这个树影的。", "shortMeaning": "这个树影我是不会卖的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f23c9ecd-155c-4cd3-b909-daea0034b7d2", "text": "我不会原谅你，除非你真诚地道歉。", "shortMeaning": "除非你真心道歉，否则我不原谅你。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2b6f0c70-595a-4242-9d99-7d8e41962580", "text": "我不会唱那首歌的。", "shortMeaning": "那首歌我不会唱。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:78c96077-8a43-4ed2-899e-e98353e20f75", "text": "我不会在这家店买任何东西。", "shortMeaning": "这家店我什么都不会买。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2a1cf780-1784-44c9-9386-3324894dd95f", "text": "我不会在这里呆很久。", "shortMeaning": "我在这儿待不久。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f00f0c8b-cddb-481d-8f20-9056c2c5cce7", "text": "我不会在这里白吃白喝的。", "shortMeaning": "我不会在这儿白吃白喝。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:807bace3-e8fa-4ef3-8211-6d93aa096e6b", "text": "我不会堕落到他那个地步。", "shortMeaning": "我不会堕落到他那份上。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e36877c4-3e96-4a10-a8e7-fa79d47ad078", "text": "我不会嫁给一个愚蠢的男人。", "shortMeaning": "我不嫁愚蠢的男人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9c6a31c0-cc4c-4447-8b1f-bd41156c15b3", "text": "我不会想到有一天我会在维基百科查找“伟哥”。", "shortMeaning": "我没想过有一天会在维基百科上查“伟哥”这种词。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cfca437d-92e4-4f8f-a408-3159a065541d", "text": "我不会抛弃我所有的想法。", "shortMeaning": "我不会把自己的想法全抛开。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f2df6447-08d8-4b11-a633-8266af8d69bd", "text": "我不会背着你干什么的。", "shortMeaning": "我不会瞒着你做什么。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:62ae505a-26d7-4d6e-8571-1d5276a68ca3", "text": "我不会表现出恐惧。", "shortMeaning": "我不会露出害怕的样子。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4253a07e-0e88-4298-b841-5e933fae81c9", "text": "我不会让你跳下去的。", "shortMeaning": "我不许你跳下去。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d8940fe1-badc-4b1a-b096-4be1adfffc1d", "text": "我不会讲英语，更不用说德语了。", "shortMeaning": "英语我都不会，德语更谈不上。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:592d0287-64af-46be-b16b-4cab804cd219", "text": "我不会说你的语言，所以你只要回答我“是”或“不”。", "shortMeaning": "我不懂你的话，你只答“是”或“不”。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:fb01a55d-a6fe-4f19-8839-26b90fbe068f", "text": "我不会说孟加拉语。", "shortMeaning": "孟加拉语我不会说。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2eb48a4f-d383-48fe-8ebd-616db0d35526", "text": "我不会说法语，也不会说德语。", "shortMeaning": "法语德语我都不会。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:13a24e3b-2710-46bb-b02b-613ac67fddfc", "text": "我不但吃了抓饭，而且还吃了烤肉串。", "shortMeaning": "我不光吃了抓饭，还吃了烤肉串。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:46489e22-b434-4e3c-bb2e-3406da03f722", "text": "我不信谣言。你信吗？", "shortMeaning": "谣言我不信，你信吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:36aa40e9-8ec6-49af-a22c-95c4da07fdc3", "text": "我不像你想的那么傻。", "shortMeaning": "我没你想的那么笨。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:fde5e07e-cbd5-40f9-b146-1c919091c6a3", "text": "我不像你那么乐观。", "shortMeaning": "我没你那么想得开。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cd4269dd-56f4-40aa-8ca2-69fd3838dce5", "text": "我不像你那样爱说话。", "shortMeaning": "我不像你那么爱讲话。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a97973e6-6605-4a9b-9582-9b372dc73f59", "text": "我不允许你用我的钢笔。", "shortMeaning": "我的钢笔不许你用。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:80f77bfe-ceb1-4244-90a0-fc1a62f4a012", "text": "我不允许你那样做。", "shortMeaning": "我不许你那么干。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2e78992c-1f06-4910-8c11-7b9b24a85a0b", "text": "我不关心财富和名声。", "shortMeaning": "钱财名声我都不在乎。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8c0f352d-9dfe-467d-9031-933c43634203", "text": "我不再是你的助手了。", "shortMeaning": "我不再给你当助手了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:526fbc6f-5bb0-4c6b-b02f-15e9bead75d0", "text": "我不再跟他一起生活了。", "shortMeaning": "我不再和他一块过日子。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cb0595ba-cae0-4196-903e-59c27564555a", "text": "我不可能全都想到。", "shortMeaning": "我不可能什么都想到。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:04d55adf-9c89-4727-8917-9b405dd44b05", "text": "我不可能对女人说话。", "shortMeaning": "我没法跟女人说话。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7e7e617f-69e5-42f7-8d51-55b984337fbc", "text": "我不可能想到方便的例子。", "shortMeaning": "我想不出合适的例子。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8083829d-f7b1-4b17-b07d-792b50ee9ed8", "text": "我不吃肉、不吃鱼、不吃海鲜，也不吃荤汤。", "shortMeaning": "我不吃鱼、肉、海鲜，荤汤也不喝。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:388be27c-b57c-46d4-b6f0-29e5356bd6d6", "text": "我不吃胡萝卜。我不爱吃。", "shortMeaning": "胡萝卜我不吃，不爱那味儿。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:95230f19-8337-43f4-b994-4f444875c8ea", "text": "我不同意他的看法。", "shortMeaning": "他的看法我不赞成。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:da63e3fa-cb1c-4fd0-976d-e3690dfb818f", "text": "我不同意你的看法。", "shortMeaning": "你的看法我不认同。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c7970116-eac8-40d5-81ac-7b6aeef58c3a", "text": "我不同意你的说法。", "shortMeaning": "你的说法我不赞同。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2fd76ec6-3483-464e-8df4-7cd7cd977f6c", "text": "我不同意她一个人去那儿。", "shortMeaning": "我不许她独自去那儿。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ebd2f237-b5c4-42ca-979e-7292566e1776", "text": "我不否认这件事发生了，可是一个例子算不上证据。", "shortMeaning": "我不否认这事有过，可一个例子不算凭据。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:add07ca9-1102-4a73-bfa3-7ccdafe84401", "text": "我不和我哥住一起。", "shortMeaning": "我不跟我哥一块住。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:180186fb-6d2b-425d-aef0-8b50c84eaa33", "text": "我不喜欢做那个总是挤牛奶的人。", "shortMeaning": "我不愿老当那个挤牛奶的人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:baaebed9-4dd2-43b5-b2e4-2d76ea40d3c5", "text": "我不喜欢出去玩，常常在家泡壶咖啡，跟朋友下围棋象棋。", "shortMeaning": "我不爱出门，常在家泡咖啡跟朋友下棋。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:13d1a061-45cc-47e2-bb84-b9f15ae018d5", "text": "我不喜欢学习不规则动词。", "shortMeaning": "我不爱学不规则动词。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:70484ee8-5b25-492d-ac3f-c2f4111f8653", "text": "我不喜欢猫，我弟弟也不喜欢。", "shortMeaning": "我不爱猫，我弟弟也不爱。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d3fa5f5e-a0a5-42a7-8ccd-016570052cb1", "text": "我不在乎是否听起来自然，别人能理解就好。", "shortMeaning": "我不管说得顺不顺，别人听懂就行。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8d668031-bcc1-4851-85e1-da46834b10b8", "text": "我不在乎花多少钱。", "shortMeaning": "花多少钱我都不在乎。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:08e4cfb1-d4e2-4bbf-816f-044e74233f8b", "text": "我不在意他们说什么。", "shortMeaning": "他们说什么我不在意。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:26949dbf-7bed-4fa6-b3a9-f6f210499ba6", "text": "我不在意在六点钟起床。", "shortMeaning": "六点起床我不在乎。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e3c9778c-4812-48db-b3be-511698df2ce8", "text": "我不在的时候有没有人来？", "shortMeaning": "我不在时有人来过吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6624ced2-f369-4f2d-9832-dd79c581e6fb", "text": "我不在的时候，他将是我的代理人。", "shortMeaning": "我不在时，由他代我办事。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1d892df1-8f07-4ef4-891b-caa67cd4d80b", "text": "我不在的时候，他跑来找过我。", "shortMeaning": "我不在时他跑来找过我。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d39207fd-5851-4540-83f6-29334f8a93cf", "text": "我不在的时候，你能照顾我的狗吗？", "shortMeaning": "我不在时你能照看我的狗吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ac60eef9-8643-4187-9227-ea3db6d98478", "text": "我不在讨论这个问题的状态。", "shortMeaning": "我现在没心思讨论这事。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:48c20ecd-f256-444e-a761-b317c1786fe1", "text": "我不太同意你的看法。", "shortMeaning": "你的看法我不大赞成。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:28a64771-d5a1-429e-8fc0-d91825b68b02", "text": "我不太喜欢喝咖啡。", "shortMeaning": "咖啡我不大爱喝。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5395aef8-c46f-43a5-8411-07e79cc9b0d8", "text": "我不太擅长打高尔夫球。", "shortMeaning": "高尔夫我打得不怎么样。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:417329d0-63f3-4a4a-aca0-862de69729be", "text": "我不太明白他说什么。", "shortMeaning": "他说什么我不大明白。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4d54afdc-4a25-40c4-a4ba-8f6e14408188", "text": "我不太确定他希望我捐多少。", "shortMeaning": "他要我捐多少，我不太清楚。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3e9ff1cd-71e1-47b3-8327-7f7786841577", "text": "我不太确定这个单词的发音。", "shortMeaning": "这个词怎么念，我没把握。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:431c9f86-08fc-4ac6-a56e-3274868d0a3b", "text": "我不好去新天地，坐星巴克，也要走走襄阳路市场，做做月工资全化光的人。", "shortMeaning": "我要去新天地、坐星巴克，也逛逛襄阳路市场，做个把工资花光的人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6268532c-e476-4afa-9c18-9e9e34cbf39d", "text": "我不小心上错了车。", "shortMeaning": "我一不留神上错了车。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f42f8db7-f1ca-4a79-9996-4da99ea1daeb", "text": "我不小心打落了一个花瓶。", "shortMeaning": "我失手打掉了一个花瓶。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b3649ac8-7f39-41e2-92c8-67a9583b3178", "text": "我不小心进错了别人的房间。", "shortMeaning": "我误进了别人的房间。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:30ec278a-1fe3-4044-804e-df17b666e564", "text": "我不应该一个人工作这么多。", "shortMeaning": "我不该一个人干这么多活。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b326e36b-885a-4f67-8465-9f35ad8f3d9a", "text": "我不很熟悉他的作品。", "shortMeaning": "他的作品我不太熟。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1ecd05d7-6677-46a0-b1c6-ebd655b727ba", "text": "我不得不一整天都呆在床上。", "shortMeaning": "我只得在床上躺一整天。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b4b47ea0-f0ab-4bb5-80dc-dab27ad53cbb", "text": "我不得不一整天都待在床上。", "shortMeaning": "我只好整天待在床上不动。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e8d5ba7f-9aa5-4fb3-846a-2bfe8b965d4d", "text": "我不得不向她道歉。", "shortMeaning": "我只好向她赔不是。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ac35f307-515c-41e5-86b4-d0b352315738", "text": "我不得不在树下躲雨。", "shortMeaning": "我只好在树下避雨。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:601a74f8-3618-42e3-b5a6-a83f8bda8eaa", "text": "我不得不戴耳塞来阻隔旁边建筑工地的所有噪音。", "shortMeaning": "旁边工地吵得很，我只好戴耳塞。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:29fbeec7-83c2-4f82-b2ef-c1bc68eb0ef2", "text": "我不得不这么做以维生。", "shortMeaning": "为糊口，我不得不这么干。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1e52aecf-3d71-429b-b8a4-fd623871e913", "text": "我不必知道所有的细节。", "shortMeaning": "细节我不用全知道。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c54b1898-3835-4ea0-ab84-2f9bbf4997a8", "text": "我不忍目睹这种残酷的行径。", "shortMeaning": "这么残忍的作法，我不忍看。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:aac82ea9-9658-4f3e-a2f1-d66aea97c580", "text": "我不怎么想住在澳大利亚。", "shortMeaning": "我不太想住澳洲。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d5c6fe85-5a5c-45d0-ad52-e8ae1f2dc87b", "text": "我不怎么明白您说什么。", "shortMeaning": "您说的话我不大懂。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c84acf75-b352-4836-9ea8-8e64ebd2a24d", "text": "我不想一个人过情人节。", "shortMeaning": "情人节我不想一个人过。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ce87903d-701b-4cae-a594-dfc7212f515b", "text": "我不想为这句子做翻译。", "shortMeaning": "这句我不想译。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:baa9cc50-010f-4a65-b23b-2c5912950957", "text": "我不想买这张地毯。", "shortMeaning": "这块地毯我不想买。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5f292eab-06f7-4cd8-833b-6a177c08d72a", "text": "我不想买这样的沙发。", "shortMeaning": "这样的沙发我不想要。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:54f38e7f-e3e8-4536-abc0-b8eacae17612", "text": "我不想你把这个事情告诉任何人。", "shortMeaning": "这事我不想你告诉任何人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4cb173ca-eb09-4df5-8c1d-1e685c02bf0d", "text": "我不想做你老婆了。", "shortMeaning": "我不想再当你老婆了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:df5f0ce2-8061-41d6-8c58-320dbe56c007", "text": "我不想再听你抱怨了。", "shortMeaning": "你的牢骚我不想再听了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4907c2f7-e7ad-448e-9591-04b02b40a4bf", "text": "我不想再听到其他借口了。", "shortMeaning": "别的借口我不想再听。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1f6bceab-a8d9-49d4-b012-0c4de40a5cf0", "text": "我不想再和他们联系了。", "shortMeaning": "我不想再跟他们来往。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3256ede6-6688-4a7b-b69b-995b0600585d", "text": "我不想再失去你一次。", "shortMeaning": "我不想再失掉你一回。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0dcd4c93-ff3e-4a23-90dc-b3c2aacd57a6", "text": "我不想再次去那儿。", "shortMeaning": "那地方我不想再去了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:15d938f9-7d97-491a-852c-ba1f0c326637", "text": "我不想冒犯任何人。", "shortMeaning": "我不想得罪谁。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f6dc65d6-55ae-4aa7-a6ac-d259fd422007", "text": "我不想分析这事实的原因，因为那样我就不得不进入政治领域，这是我所想避免的。我只是实话实说。", "shortMeaning": "这事的缘由我不去分析，一分析就得扯到政治，那是我要避开的；我只照实说。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6bd41f64-d8af-40de-8873-5aa09b57220b", "text": "我不想去那儿，他也不想。", "shortMeaning": "我不愿去那儿，他也不愿。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c7784c5d-8434-4d9f-982c-f4c57cb2b4bc", "text": "我不想听你的理论。", "shortMeaning": "你那套道理我不想听。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ac74aa01-d512-4674-ba1b-611e8659b4d8", "text": "我不想和一个陌生人分享旅馆房间。", "shortMeaning": "我不愿跟生人合住一间客房。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9d81b4f0-16d0-4276-97bc-21624b9705d3", "text": "我不想在恐惧中生活。", "shortMeaning": "我不想活在害怕里。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:42d998ac-8d60-40ea-b523-7d224f5f56fe", "text": "我不想坐汽车去，宁可走去。", "shortMeaning": "我不坐车去，宁肯走着。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5604e8c3-4c23-4de1-8a35-2e72e8cbc4d6", "text": "我不想承担这样一个风险。", "shortMeaning": "这样的风险我不想担。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9855825e-408d-4bc4-8bc8-f2119b71ec4c", "text": "我不想把简单的事情搞复杂。", "shortMeaning": "简单的事我不想弄复杂。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:07275eb9-351a-46de-a5d4-a0302ffd858a", "text": "我不想放弃我的想法，虽然一些想法有点极端。", "shortMeaning": "有些想法虽偏激，我也不想放弃。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cd0f88fb-f017-44e2-81e4-bd17891cccb1", "text": "我不想有任何误会。", "shortMeaning": "我不想留下任何误会。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6882362f-e08b-4338-bac0-9d441ed639a5", "text": "我不想看到你们的脸。", "shortMeaning": "你们的脸我不想看。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d0d1fb04-57ef-4ab3-81f4-9530ecf4a2f5", "text": "我不想给你这种印象。", "shortMeaning": "我不想让你这样想我。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b2781ad6-84ee-4819-b4f3-71025e961611", "text": "我不想考雅思和托福。", "shortMeaning": "雅思托福我都不想考。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2de8e22c-7569-4a18-b4b8-760cf20b2c4c", "text": "我不想花费超过10美元。", "shortMeaning": "我不想花过十美金。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4d243c84-790a-4511-9cd7-001e7c7ab17a", "text": "我不想被牵扯到这件事里。", "shortMeaning": "我不想被卷进这事。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ec9d8781-545b-416d-a0e1-7b56274f852d", "text": "我不想要您的东西。", "shortMeaning": "您的东西我不要。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5767ce28-84c0-4101-96d2-ff8d6cd497ad", "text": "我不想要老婆，我想要性伴侣。", "shortMeaning": "我不要老婆，我要的是性伴侣。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e412a7a3-57ea-4ef4-aec7-4d634b60586b", "text": "我不想让这个秘密暴露出来。", "shortMeaning": "我不想让这秘密露出来。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b1440e9e-df28-4dde-9958-a9f07603cf80", "text": "我不想谈论这个问题。", "shortMeaning": "这个问题我不想谈。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f5bd7f1a-1037-45d4-96ae-1b4a68da9ce5", "text": "我不想谈论这件事。", "shortMeaning": "这件事我不想多说。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1036bcf6-6353-449c-9e52-706cc94c98c7", "text": "我不想过这样的生活。", "shortMeaning": "这样的日子我不想过了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c254d28f-787b-44c3-8d16-de61f42967c9", "text": "我不想这种事发生。", "shortMeaning": "这种事我不想它发生。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8200d43e-fd9f-4f98-afc6-f1b9972ab1d2", "text": "我不愿意勾起久远的回忆。", "shortMeaning": "我不愿去翻那些久远的记忆。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3346d504-f230-4060-80e0-1994743c61b0", "text": "我不懂你什么意思。", "shortMeaning": "你什么意思我不明白。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b7e787b3-5492-4f0d-b0f0-f7332795e08e", "text": "我不懂你在说什么。", "shortMeaning": "你说的话我听不懂。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1e8f2576-27eb-4890-8c95-fdfe1c3f4ae0", "text": "我不懂发生了什么。", "shortMeaning": "出了什么事我不明白。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:279747e6-1f94-4347-8880-19e6899af05f", "text": "我不懂汉语，但我想学。", "shortMeaning": "汉语我不会，但我想学。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d2ae1873-c53e-494f-bbb5-d06cde363a47", "text": "我不戴眼镜也能阅读。", "shortMeaning": "我不戴眼镜也看得清书。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:815b6432-167c-4fd0-a6e9-c022d88a683c", "text": "我不指望从你身上得到什么。", "shortMeaning": "我不指望从你这儿得什么。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:31f4c867-0946-4667-a274-7fb03bfc7985", "text": "我不挑剔，我什么都吃。", "shortMeaning": "我不挑食，什么都吃。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:30e4b2f0-4b6c-4df1-93cf-32ef3afa4ca9", "text": "我不擅长画画，但我会写文章。", "shortMeaning": "我不会画，但会写东西。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:845bb258-3249-414e-972d-68841bc361c8", "text": "我不敢对他说这种话。", "shortMeaning": "这种话我不敢跟他说。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:71e62b26-3bdd-4073-8d6f-187ccdf29210", "text": "我不敢相信眼前发生的这一切。", "shortMeaning": "眼前这一切，我不敢信。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9ee49cdd-4bb3-4a70-817b-c5589bc7381c", "text": "我不敢走在前面，太黑了。", "shortMeaning": "前面太黑，我不敢走在前头。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:475f5595-997d-4c31-a225-0a4c4c9b5677", "text": "我不敢问测验成绩，因为我很怕听到结果。", "shortMeaning": "我怕听分数，不敢问测验结果。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
